WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:12.746
How do I eat my rice?

2
00:00:12.747 --> 00:00:19.012
I use a spoon.

3
00:00:19.013 --> 00:00:24.937
How do I eat my noodles?

4
00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:31.339
I use chopsticks.

5
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:37.085
How do I eat my soup?

6
00:00:37.086 --> 00:00:43.690
I use a spoon.

7
00:00:43.691 --> 00:00:49.345
How do I eat my meat?

8
00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:55.743
I use a knife and fork.

9
00:00:55.744 --> 00:01:01.761
How do I eat my cake?

10
00:01:01.762 --> 00:01:08.434
I use a fork.

11
00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:14.803
How do I eat my spaghetti?

12
00:01:14.804 --> 00:01:21.738
I use a fork.

13
00:01:21.739 --> 00:01:27.679
How do I eat my sushi?

14
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:34.508
I use chopsticks.

15
00:01:34.509 --> 00:01:38.674
How do I eat this, then?

16
00:01:38.675 --> 00:01:44.228
I use my hands.
